{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "scale-county-avft",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.78, Phase 6. `scale-county-avft`: a Washtenaw County SINGLE-scale inventory over a NON-DEFAULT avft table (`inputs/washtenaw-county-avft.esm`), so MOVES 5's AVFTControlStrategy rewrites sampleVehiclePopulation before any generator runs. Every fuel of the passenger car (21) and light commercial truck (32) -- gasoline, diesel, E85, electric -- and the combination long-haul truck's (62) diesel and electric (MOVES adds its CNG: \"Added missing vehicle selection\"); THC, CO, NOx and Total Energy at running exhaust, start exhaust and extended idle, THC at fuel vapor venting, PM2.5 brake and tire wear; July 2020, weekdays, hour 8, at `<aggregateBy key=\"Hour\"/>` and `<outputtimestep value=\"Hour\"/>`, road types 1 and 4 (MOVES selects all five). MOVESOutput is 10,188 rows.\n\nWHAT IT DISCRIMINATES is the rewritten fleet: 37 sample-vehicle rows at model years 2010, 2015, 2018 and 2020 move between fuels and engine technologies through applyNewFraction's ADD branch (18 rows, four of them filled from zero -- the diesel car, the electric light truck and both electric long-haul drives, new source bins), its SUBTRACT branch (19, four emptied to zero), its no-change branch and an ignored combination, and every consumer of sampleVehiclePopulation reads the rewritten table: the source-bin distribution behind every exhaust, wear and venting rate, TankVaporVenting's regulatory-class weights, and TAG's hotelling split for source type 62 -- but not BaseRateGenerator's EV sales share, which reads the DEFAULT copy at county scale (lib/avft.esm, docs/esm-conventions.md §129).\n\n`n_outputRate` is bound to 10188, the (pollutant-process, cohort) pairs of the run's one (county, month, hour) cell; `n_sourceBin` 4, the electric long-haul cohort's two drives times two regulatory classes; `n_physicsRow` 24, the three source types' physics rows.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "single-county-domain",
      "road-type-axis",
      "control-strategy",
      "avft"
    ]
  },
